{
  "dom_id": "step-191943",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Converting a Recursive Formula to an Explicit Formula Using Function Notation",
  "problem": "What is the explicit formula for the $n$th term of the sequence\n\n$$\nf(n+1) = f(n) - 5,\\, \\qquad f(1) = 3,\\, \\qquad n\\geq 1?\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "The explicit formula for the $n$th term of an arithmetic sequence (in function notation) is\n\n$$\nf(n) = f(1) + (n-1)d, \\quad n \\geq 1,\n$$\n\nso we need to determine the first term $f(1)$ and the common difference $d.$\n\nWe are given that the first term is $f(1)={\\color{blue}3},$ and we can use the recursive rule to compute the second term, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(2) & =f(1)-5 \\\\  & =3-5 \\\\  & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the first and second terms, we can compute the common difference:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =f(2)-f(1) \\\\  & =-2-3 \\\\  & =-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we substitute $f(1) = {\\color{blue}3}$ and $d={\\color{red}-5}$ into the formula for the $n$th term:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\nf(n)&= f(1)+(n-1)d \\[5pt]\n&= {\\color{blue}3} + (n - 1)({\\color{red}-5})  \\[5pt]\n& =3 - 5n + 5 \\[5pt]\n&=8 - 5n\t\t\n}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the formula for the $n$th term is\n\n$$\nf(n)=8 - 5n, \\qquad n \\geq 1.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-191943\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"191943\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14393\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-191943\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-14\">Converting a Recursive Formula to an Explicit Formula Using Function Notation</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"191943\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                       